title: "helios-spaceweather-connectors"
abstract: "Production-grade Python adapters for six space-weather data sources (NASA DONKI, CCMC SEP Scoreboards A/B/C, NOAA SWPC, NASA CDDIS GIMs, GOES, DSCOVR), normalized to a common feature schema with feature-level provenance per helios-provenance-spec."
